~ greeting
Mysterious Otter: Greetings!

=> END

~ awaiting_snack
Mysterious Otter: I require a {{DeliveryManager.current_snack.snack_name}} for my [wave]special concoction[/wave].

Mysterious Otter: Please bring it post-haste!

=> END

~ wrong_snack
Mysterious Otter: Hmm, not quite what my [wave]special concoction[/wave] needs.

Mysterious Otter: I would recommend you bring what I asked for...lest I be compelled to [shake]hex[/shake] you!

=> END

~ snack_received
Mysterious Otter: Ah, splendid!

Mysterious Otter: My [wave]special concoction[/wave] is almost complete...

=> END